        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 1</p><hr /><p>This multipurpose hiking and climbing tool doubles as a modular weapon. It has a retractable carbon fiber cable that can support up to 14 Bulk. If you're trained with this weapon, and it has the grapple trait, you can use it to [[/act grapple]] a Medium or smaller creature up to 20 feet away. You can continue to Grapple to keep your hold on the target so long as the target remains within 20 feet, and you continue to hold the grapnel pick. The @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Grabbed] creature gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Escape, and Grapple checks attempted with grapnel picks take a –2 penalty unless you're adjacent to the target.</p>"
